        "execSummary":  "Barclays\u0027 Claude expansion is one of the most concrete large-scale AI deployments in global financial services, with 16,000 employees already using the Colleague Knowledge Assistant and 120,000 daily emails processed automatically in Global Markets. The plan to extend Claude Code to most software engineers by 2027 signals AI-augmented development becoming standard practice, not a pilot program. For enterprise customer-support leaders, the email classification and enrichment use case is directly replicable: it reduces manual triage while maintaining the governance and audit trails regulators require. The key caveat is that Barclays\u0027 regulated environment demanded significant security architecture investment — organizations without that foundation will face a longer runway.",
